                                      +--> Agent Runtime
                                      +--> Python TTS
                                      |
                                      +--> Node.js ChartCapture
                                      +--> n8n Workflows
                                      +--> Supabase / APIs
Primary Technical Recommendation
Start with Asterisk 22 or newer where practical, verify the exact availability of chan_websocket in the target build, and implement a MediaTransport abstraction. Use WebSocket media first, AudioSocket second, and RTP External Media only when needed. Keep the media contract independent from the agent contract.
